			}]
		}
		{
			x: 3.0d
			y: -2.5d
			subtitle: "每一步都充满创造力"
			description: [
				"The Master Ninja has 500HP. He is an old, disgruntled gentleman who obeys nothing but the art of magic. And he does so well. He has eliminated the need for energy weapons by harnessing his powers into his fist. This acts as his main method of attack, although he can flex the tendons in his hand to divert magical energy elsewhere. This grants him a special resistance he can active on a whim. His magic powers come from centuries of divine wisdom exclusive to his lineage. His energy is harvested in secretive locations men have gone missing attempting to discover. The only clue to it's whereabouts is in an ancient text that was discovered in the ruins of Pompeii cerca 409 AD. The election of a new Master Ninja is foretold to coincide when the godess Lyssa cycles into her deepest fits of rage. This unique disturbance creates a monstrous energy that is captured by a stone in a mythical area untouched by man, acessible only to those who have already made contact with the stone. It is such, that as the Master Ninja goes to recharge his magical abilities, he experiences sudden death and resurrection. It is more than the force of 1000 lightning bolts combined, greater than the destructive force of 900000 atom bombs. An energy so awesome it was the task of the Olympians to construct an antimatter containment field around the site. Thankfully, the ever impatient, brutally forceful Haphaestus, solved this problem in his own sin while pursuing Athena. Being the premier builder, forgemaster, and ironworker, Haphaestus was capable of building on a scale unseen before. Athena, godess of defense, was... A vessel for his unintended creation. Not everything that is born by accident is always destined for failure, contrary to popular belief. His legacy, for better or for worse, will live on, as the planet is saved from certain doom."
				"我打这个 boss 死了 30 次才打过"
			]
